      "body": "I independently found the same issue and opened #472 before noticing this one. Closing mine as duplicate.\n\nWhile reviewing the same area, I found two more related issues that might be worth fixing together:\n\n**`setup_env.py:212` — `exit(0)` on error condition:**\n```python\nif arch not in COMPILER_EXTRA_ARGS.keys():\n    logging.error(f\"Arch {arch} is not supported yet\")\n    exit(0)  # should be sys.exit(1)\n```\n\n**`setup_env.py:85` — unhandled KeyError:**\n```python\ndef system_info():\n    return platform.system(), ARCH_ALIAS[platform.machine()]\n```\nOn unrecognized platforms (e.g. `i686`, `riscv64`), this raises `KeyError` before the architecture check at line 210 can provide a proper error message.",
