      "body": "Submitted a comprehensive fix in #504 that addresses all 5 error-handling bugs identified in this issue and the follow-up comments:\n\n1. `sys.exit(1)` indentation in `setup_env.py:107` (original report)\n2. Same indentation bug in `e2e_benchmark.py:23`\n3. `exit(0)` on unsupported arch in `setup_env.py:212` (per @sudo-init's comment)\n4. `ARCH_ALIAS` KeyError on unrecognized architectures at `setup_env.py:85`\n5. `SUPPORTED_QUANT_TYPES` KeyError in `parse_args()` at `setup_env.py:225`\n\nTotal diff is 7 lines added, 4 removed across 2 files.",
